Output docs/assets/revisions.gif

Set Theme "OneDark"
Set Shell "bash"
Set Padding 20
Set FontSize 24
Set FontFamily "Fira Code"
Set Columns 98
Set Rows 30

Hide
  Type `alias nyaml=./dist/nyaml`  Enter
  Type `nyaml view testdata/revisions/*.yaml` Enter
  Sleep 500ms
Show

